<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Marine Courage - 120,000/10 tonnes coal Newcastle/Pohang 1/15 Aug $6.23 fio seven days Posteel.</p>
<p>Able Director - 130,000/10 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Ensted end July $6.50 fio scale load/30,000 shinc Elsam.</p>
<p>TBN - 55,000/5 tonnes coal Roberts Bay/Ijmuiden 6/17 July $10.50 fio 20,000 shinc/two days shinc CNR.</p>
<p>ORE - Caspian Trader - 80,000/10 tonnes ore Cape Lambert/Rotterdam July approx. $7 fio six days shinc Robe River.</p>
</text>
